{"1693770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Port Aphelion", "steam_appid": 1693770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Port Aphelion is a trading-simulation and adventure game where players build their economic empire through honest trade, smuggling, bounty-hunting, or all-out piracy!<br><br>Features include:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open World<br></li><li>Economic Simulation<br></li><li>Story mode and Sandbox</li></ul><br>Gameplay includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate the Politics of Multiple Factions.<br></li><li>Define Complex Trade Routes to Maximize your Profits!<br></li><li>Play as Merchant, Smuggler, Pirate, or Bounty-Hunter!<br></li><li>Modify game settings to generate unique star systems!<br></li><li>Replay again and again with fractal-generated worlds!<br></li><li>As you build large fleets, upgrade your ship captains' skills to improve their ability in combat, trade, and smuggling.<br></li><li>Space Battles, Space Piracy, Space Marauding, and Space Madness!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693770/extras/81b3849e5eb3d53345caf528777538cd.poster.avif?t=1626193332\" width=400 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693770/extras/81b3849e5eb3d53345caf528777538cd.webm?t=1626193332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693770/extras/81b3849e5eb3d53345caf528777538cd.mp4?t=1626193332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "Port Aphelion is a trading-simulation and adventure game where players build their economic empire through honest trade, smuggling, bounty-hunting, or all-out piracy!<br><br>Features include:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open World<br></li><li>Economic Simulation<br></li><li>Story mode and Sandbox</li></ul><